  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The app registers a single `autocomplete` management command with subcommands install, status, refresh, context, and uninstall, invoked as `python manage.py autocomplete ...`. `autocomplete context` prints a compact markdown summary of project-local commands with flags and help plus per-app migration names; `--json` prints the full cache and `--refresh` forces a rebuild first.",
